# Panic-sites budget (scripts/panic-sites.py, `just panic-sites`, ADR-0051):
# the panic-class sites per file of the tiered crates, counted by one clippy
# pass with the panic set as `-W` flags over `--lib --bins`. Each entry is a
# file that had sites when it was listed, with their count: it may go down,
# never up. An unlisted file has none. `just panic-sites-update` lowers an
# entry and removes it at zero; no entry is ever raised or added. A crate with
# no entry carries the zero attribute at its roots (`just panic-sites` names
# it).

